<title>DENMARK: Danish Kommunekredit sets 4 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Kommunekredit sets 4 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead managers Jyske Bank and Gudme Raaschou Bank said on Wednesday they were arranging a four percent, six year 705.25 million Danish crown bond for Denmark's Kommunekredit.</p>
<p>They said the bond would be listed on Copenhagen Stock exchange on November 18, 1996. No further details were given.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
